      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "或 $U_{м}^2=I_{м}^2\\left[R^2+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^2\\right]$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从等式（2.34）中可以很容易地求出电路中电流强度的",
        "振幅：",
        "$I_{м}=\\frac{U_{м}}{\\sqrt{R^2+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^2}}$ （2.39）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样，由于电路各段上的电压间的相位差，得出图43中表示",
        "的电路的总阻抗$Z$：",
        "$Z=\\sqrt{R^2+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^2}$ （2.40）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从电流强度和电压的振幅可以导出这些量的有效值，它",
        "们相互之间的关系和公式（2.39）中的振幅关系是完全一",
        "样的：",
        "$I=\\frac{U}{\\sqrt{R^2+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^2}}$ （2.41）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是图43所示的交流电路的欧姆定律. 电流强度的瞬",
        "时值随时间简谐变化：",
        "$i=I_{м}\\cos(\\omega t+\\varphi)$ （2.42）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里$\\varphi$是线路中电流强度和电压之间的相位差，它和角",
        "频率$\\omega$及电路的参数$R$、$L$、$C$有关."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "27. 交流电路中的功率"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在所有情况下，稳恒电流电路上的功率由电流强度和电",
        "压的乘积来确定：",
        "$P=UI$ （2.43）"
      ]
    },
